    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "We are pleased to bring to the rental market this well-presented own-door apartment, located in the popular Beechdale development in Ballycullen, Dublin 24.\n\nSituated on the top floor, the property offers two double bedrooms, two bathrooms and a spacious open-plan living, dining and kitchen area. The apartment is bright and well maintained throughout and also benefits from plenty of storage space.\nThere is a private balcony overlooking Dublin City, offering lovely views and a pleasant outdoor space. The property also comes with designated parking, with bin charges included in the rent.\n\nBeechdale is a well-established and sought-after development, conveniently located close to a wide range of local amenities. Lidl Ballycullen, Oldcourt Shopping Centre, SuperValu Firhouse and Woodstown Shopping Centre are all within easy reach, while the nearby Dublin Mountains provide an excellent choice of scenic walks and outdoor activities. The property is also well served by public transport, with the 15, 15B, 175, 65B, 49 and 75 bus routes all accessible nearby. The Luas Red Line and M50 are also within easy reach, providing convenient access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas. There is a wide selection of primary and secondary schools in the surrounding area, including Holy Rosary National School, Scoil Carmel, Scoil Treasa, Firhouse Educate Together, Firhouse Gaelscoil, St. Colmcille`s, Firhouse Community College, Coláiste Éanna and Sancta Maria.\n\nPlease note:\nThe property will present FURNISHED\nAvailable Immediately \nNo pets/smoking permitted"
      },
